# smalltalk-core-v1: Greetings and farewells, thanks, apologies, how-are-you, weather, weekend, hobbies and sport chat, compliments, acknowledgements, clarification and repair, and small talk that leads back to useful help; neutral and warm registers. More variants for the situations of conversation-v1 and new situations triggered by pragmatic kinds.
